/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In addition to the projects and technical aspects of a hackathon, many mini-events and small contests took place, where participants competed for a $40 mini-events prize. One of the most notable contests was the photography competition, in which participants submitted photos and others upvoted them. Notable mini-events included Among Us, Gartic Phone, and Scribbl.io. In addition, there was a custom-coded trivia bot live on the server, which participants were able to interact with every five minutes. Every question answered correctly resulted in mini-events points being earned, helping teams win prizes.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
